Value ms (\S+)
Value remote (\S+)
Value stratum (\d+)
Value poll (\d+)
Value reach (\d+)
Value lastrx (\S+)
Value last_sample (.*)

Start
  # Match header line: MS Name/IP address         Stratum Poll Reach LastRx Last sample
  ^\s*MS\s+Name/IP\s+address\s+Stratum\s+Poll\s+Reach\s+LastRx\s+Last\s+sample\s*$$
  # Skip separator line
  ^(=+\s*)*$$
  # Match data line: ^? 1.1.1.1                       0   8     0     -     +0ns[   +0ns] +/-    0ns
  ^\s*${ms}\s+${remote}\s+${stratum}\s+${poll}\s+${reach}\s+${lastrx}\s+${last_sample}\s*$$ -> Record